# Options → "Show the LED ticker in info views". On (default): the boards stay in an info view.
# Off: they hide there (the facade gets the game's own info-view look) and come back when the
# view closes. The player's info view and checkbox are put back at the end.
name ticker in info views: shown by default, hidden in info views when the option is off
live-ticker on
info-view none
ticker-in-info-views on
info-view traffic
expect-ticker shown
capture ticker-info-on
ticker-in-info-views off
expect-ticker hidden
capture ticker-info-off
info-view none
expect-ticker shown
info-view population
expect-ticker hidden
# No flash: the swap happens inside the game's switch, before the frame is drawn.
info-view-swap none shown
info-view-swap traffic hidden
info-view-swap none shown
cleanup:
info-view none
